          "docs": "Retrieve audit logs for a specific account (tenant). Use optional query parameters to filter results by creation date, users, email addresses, or account (tenant) IDs. You can also sort the results and paginate through them using `count` and `offset`. The maximum number of audit logs per request is 200. For example: \n?count=200&offset=0&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc returns audits 1-200, \n?count=200&offset=200&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc returns audits 201-400"
